# =============================================
# LINCOLNX ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# =============================================
# These values are for LOCAL DEVELOPMENT ONLY.
# On Netlify, set these in: Site settings → Environment variables
# =============================================

# Supabase connection (required - all Netlify functions depend on these)
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-public-key

# =============================================
# HOW TO GET THESE:
# 1. Go to https://supabase.com and create a new project
# 2. Open project → Project Settings → API
# 3. Copy the "Project URL" into SUPABASE_URL
# 4. Copy the "anon public" key into SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# 5. In Supabase SQL Editor, run the contents of database/schema.sql
# 6. Add both values to Netlify: Site settings → Environment variables
# =============================================